@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:维护预约及接诊</u>\n<u>安排控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者</u>" as Patient
participant "<u>:日期安排</u>" as Schedule
participant "<u>:接诊占用</u>" as Occupancy
participant "<u>:预约</u>" as Appointment
participant "<u>:预约变更</u>" as AppointmentChange
participant "工作单元" as W
participant "数据映射器" as DM
participant "权限与会话服务" as AUTH
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-01办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 办理(ctx, UC01Command)
activate K
group 本阶段同一写事务
K -> W : 开始写事务()
W --> K : 同一连接
K -> AUTH : 核对岗位及对象(ctx, 引用)
AUTH --> K : 有效授权依据或拒绝
K -> W : 核对提交(ctx, cmd)
W --> K : 新命令分支（原结果短路见公共图）
K -> DM : 装载(对象引用、连接)
DM --> K : 实体与依据快照
K -> Patient : 核对身份(患者选择)
activate Patient
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
K -> Schedule : 申请预约占用(日期、牙医、诊椅、起止)
activate Schedule
Schedule -> Occupancy : 检查并占用(患者、共同资源)
activate Occupancy
Occupancy --> Schedule : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Occupancy
Schedule --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Schedule
K -> Appointment : 确认安排(患者、已获占用、来源)
activate Appointment
opt 已有预约发生变更
Appointment -> AppointmentChange : 保留变更(旧安排、原因)
activate AppointmentChange
AppointmentChange --> Appointment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate AppointmentChange
end
Appointment --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Appointment
alt 本阶段全部校验通过
K -> DM : 保存(变更集合、连接)
DM --> K : 保存成功或版本冲突
K -> W : 校验集合与来源()
W --> K : 末校验结果
K -> W : 保存结果与审计并提交()
else 任一步骤拒绝或保存失败
K -> W : 回滚()
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,AppointmentChange
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
